# Warehouses: an internal SOAP service (@protocol: 'none'). No route is mounted; ShopService reads it in-process.

@server = http://localhost:4004
@alice = Basic alice:alice
@bob = Basic bob:bob


### No /soap route: 404, also for a user with the role of its @requires (finance)
GET {{server}}/soap/warehouses/Sites
Authorization: {{alice}}

### No unprefixed route either: 404
GET {{server}}/warehouses/Sites
Authorization: {{alice}}

### CAP does not serve it over OData either: 404
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/warehouses/Sites
Authorization: {{alice}}

### In-process through ShopService.Sites: the mock's three sites, country names from CountryCodes
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/shop/Sites
Authorization: {{alice}}

### A read by key
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/shop/Sites('WH-SOUTH')
Authorization: {{alice}}

### bob has no role finance: 403. The in-process read of ShopService checks the @requires of Warehouses for the
### request's user
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/shop/Sites
Authorization: {{bob}}
